WEBVTT

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:14.540
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.780
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.180
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.220
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.160
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:36.930
Kazuki!

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:40.230
I'll fight...

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.180
Kazuki...

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.080
I'll fight...

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:48.580
Darn it!

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.480
What's happening up there?

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.230
I'll fight...! I'll fight...!

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.430
Fight!

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:05.590
Kazuki!

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>An lntermediate Existence</i>

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:30.220
<i>Copper skin that radiates heat...</i>

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:32.990
<i>Pale blue glowing hair...</i>

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.460
<i>He's just like Victor!</i>

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.910
This is the same as breathing for me.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:56.110
lt is not my power, but my biology. l can't stop it.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.860
An energy drain...

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.190
Kazu...ki...

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.500
Victor--!

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.280
Buso...!

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.250
Come!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.510
lt will be difficult to determine

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:11.220
which of us is victorious in a short period of time.

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:16.200
lt seems you are not yet capable of flight.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.130
The mist has cleared.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.970
We must do our best to avoid exposing

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.230
the power of alchemy to the eyes of the masses.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.770
Enough meals and fighting for now...

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:35.680
One hundred years...
Shall l see a bit of the world?

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:37.520
Do you mean to flee?

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.680
There is no hurry.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.950
Just like me, you have obtained a life

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:46.620
that is as close to immortality that one might find on this earth.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.760
Sooner or later, we shall settle matters.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.030
Not just you.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:58.700
The Alchemist Warriors, homunculi and all the things that alchemy has created

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.570
will some day meet their end by my hands.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.810
Alchemy itself is my enemy.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.710
Victor!

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:08.270
From this day forth,

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.580
you shall taste the same hardships l suffered 100 years ago.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:15.020
Best be well prepared...

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.490
Don't chase after him, Kazuki...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.630
Fight, Victor!

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:33.700
Kazuki!

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.110
l'm begging you, Kazuki...

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:54.860
I'll do anything. l put you in this form.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.490
I'll do anything to make it up to you.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.970
So, l'm pleading with you...

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.000
Even if your form should change...

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.880
Please let your heart remain unchanged...

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.910
Please...

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.280
Tokiko...

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.700
Papillon!

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:33.970
Chono!

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:35.990
l saw it all, Muto...

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:41.030
l never dreamed that you would give up your humanity!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:44.440
This does not please me,
Kazuki Muto!

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:50.310
After all your efforts to stop me from becoming a superhuman,

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:54.020
killing me once already, how could you forsake your own humanity!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.580
Even your hypocrisy should have its limits--!

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:02.430
You shouldn't be pushing your body beyond its limits.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.030
Are you all right?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.070
Shut up!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.170
Chono...

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.470
What?!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.810
l will never give up my humanity.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.400
My body is returning to its original form.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.940
lsn't it just that you're in remission?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:24.780
lf your fighting instinct is ignited, won't you change form

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:28.620
when the black kakugane embedded inside your chest is activated?

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.660
lnterpret it any way you like,

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:39.790
you have become an entity that is midway between a human and Victor.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.140
Can you ever return to your original human form?

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.000
The Warrior Chief...

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:48.210
Tokiko?

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:49.980
Everything's okay.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:56.180
Or shall l say, the black kakugane, the things that happened to Kazuki...

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.980
the Warrior Chief might know what to do...

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:00.610
Yes, l see...

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.150
Even if you underlings don't know anything,

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:07.190
the higher official just might!

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.390
I'll kill you!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.930
Go ahead and try!

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.190
Okay, let's go.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.870
But first...

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:26.810
Everyone's asleep.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.610
That's no surprise.
They're very fatigued.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:32.920
But l'm glad...

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.650
Everyone seems to be okay...

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.390
l made the rounds,

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.330
but there don't seem to be any human casualties.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:42.760
That's good...

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.860
What do you mean, good?

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:50.530
Some of this damage was inflicted by you in your "Victor" form.

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:52.470
Don't gloss over it.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.940
Your next stop is the LXE safe house.

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:00.050
I'll go on ahead before you.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:02.880
Papillon!

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.610
What do you think you're doing?!

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:09.450
Do your best, homunculus!

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.820
Tokiko, you too, hurry!

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:13.490
Quit fooling around!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.390
Ohhh... it's tearing off!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.260
My lower half is being torn from my body!

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:20.000
Don't worry! l'm an expert at hanging on!

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.400
Tokiko...

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.470
lf you're in a hurry, use this.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:32.340
My treasure. lt's parked behind the dorm.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.910
That's against school rules.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:39.780
You'll be suspended if they find out, so be careful.

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:43.120
Well then, I'll borrow it with gratitude.

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:48.320
Moon!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:56.170
—Moon!
—Moon!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:02.280
Moon!

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:09.620
That Silver Skin Alternate Type is a wonderful design.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.050
But alas, how unfortunate.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.650
Buso Renkin specializing in defense...

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.950
is like trying to cool a hot stone with a drop of water.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.590
Your subordinate gave it all he had for two full days.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.060
Now, what about you?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.230
l wonder how long you can entertain us?

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:32.200
lt seems l was being a bit too hotheaded.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.280
—Moon?
—Moon?!

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:04.700
Wh-What's this?!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:39.270
Moon! So you can use your powers in this way, too.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.000
Although l expected you'd be more troublesome than your subordinate--

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.200
Smash! Bravo Crush!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:57.790
Heeey!

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.460
Tokiko!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.020
Hey, quit rocking the boat!

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.130
You're late!

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.960
Hey, she's calling us slow!

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:07.360
lf it hadn't been for you,

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:08.870
we would have gotten there a long time ago.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.870
Kazuki! Can you see the safe house from there?

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:15.300
Yes, l can. Just a little further!

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:19.410
—Moon!
—Moon!

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:23.280
What a shock! l have lost.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:25.380
Bravo!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.950
Sorry. l had my hands full.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:40.160
A black kakugane...
The third existence...

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:42.960
This is the first l've heard of either of them.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:44.370
ls that so...

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.070
The underlings are useless,

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.110
and the one in charge is useless as well...?

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.180
What a waste of time.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.310
lf l want something,

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.610
l simply have to grab for it with my own hands.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.750
lt's best to do my own investigations, after all.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:05.390
ls that so you can revert Kazuki back to human form?

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:08.530
Or, so you change your form to be like Victor?

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:13.360
Both... So that the human Kazuki Muto,

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.930
will be defeated at the hands of the Super Awesome me!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.440
That is the conclusion l desire.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:23.400
So, Muto, don't be letting go of any more of your humanity.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.140
l don't really need to hear that from you.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:30.520
Be sure to heal your wounds properly.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.980
lf that's how you feel, then don't hang off of me like that again.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.650
Wait! lf we let him get away like this—

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.450
Let him go, Warrior Tokiko.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.490
But!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.330
lf he wants to investigate,

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.260
then letting him move freely while under surveillance could be helpful.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:46.760
Besides, you're in no shape to fight.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:50.170
There is no need to overdo it.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.370
Why don't we call it a day?

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:53.870
Yes...

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.740
Then, there's that guy to consider.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:58.000
Moon?

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:00.940
l thought of taking him to the LXE hearing,

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:03.850
but if he was involved in Victor's restoration,

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.180
he may know something.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:08.650
Then let's have him tell us everything.

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.690
<i>Moon, l lost,</i> <i>so l guess l have no choice.</i>

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.620
<i>There will be a change in</i> <i>our scheduled programming.</i>

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:19.530
<i>We'll begin with a follow-up report</i> <i>on this incident.</i>

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:24.930
<i>The mass fainting incident that</i> <i>occurred at Ginsei Gakuen High School</i>

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.030
<i>resulted in injuries to 26 people.</i>

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.200
<i>Forty-two were hospitalized,</i>

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:32.470
<i>and the number of students complaining</i> <i>of headache and nausea</i>

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:35.710
<i>continued to increase,</i> <i>approaching 100.</i>

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:44.560
For the present, l shall return to headquarters.

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:47.650
l intend to ask the people above us

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:50.600
about the true nature of the incidents that occurred 100 years ago.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:55.400
Rest assured, l will be sure to obtain some clues.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:56.530
Okay...

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:00.730
You seem more worried about the others than yourself.

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:06.710
True, some will surely be traumatized by today's events.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.110
However strong the warrior,

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:12.950
we cannot always protect people in their hearts and psyche.

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:15.150
However!

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:18.660
You have protected every single life!

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:22.620
You destroyed LXE and saved this town.

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:27.700
Well done, Warrior Kazuki,
Warrior Tokiko. Bravo!

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.140
Your missions are completed.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:36.240
Take a rest for a while until l return.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:40.050
l'm off! Chitchiino!

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:46.540
For the first time, l placed third for my grades!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.020
Thank god! l'm at No. 2.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.620
Easily, Number One.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.320
Dead last...

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:53.380
<i>Loser...stupid...dolt...failure...dead last.</i>

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.720
l lost out even to Okakura...

00:14:57.600 --> 00:15:00.570
l cut class because of special training.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:05.270
lt can't be helped, but it's hard to let go.

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:11.170
Hard to believe this is the same guy who was fighting for us.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.180
Well, he is Mappii's big brother, after all.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:21.310
Well, let's put off thinking about a penalty game for Kazuki

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.320
and get into the main topic.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.190
The beach?!

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.560
Wait a minute!
What are you talking about?

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:33.690
Huh? l told you the morning of the big battle.

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:36.130
We're all going to go swimming at the beach.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.260
l heard that, but you were serious?

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:41.000
We're leaving tomorrow and staying one night and two days.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.010
l don't own a swimsuit!

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:44.500
What about the school's swimwear?

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:47.010
l'd look stupid wearing one of those at the beach!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.170
l think Daihama would be happy.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:50.950
Kazuki!

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:00.220
l'm finished...

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:04.990
<i>The first semester at</i>
<i>Ginsei Gakuen High School ended today.</i>

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:09.500
<i>The truth behind the mass fainting incident</i> <i>remains a mystery,</i>

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.600
<i>but things are gradually</i> <i>going back to normal.</i>

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:15.000
There's no way they'll know about what happened.

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:17.540
None of us said a word about it either.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:20.710
Or rather, we didn't even understand it ourselves.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.250
<i>However...</i>

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:25.480
<i>similar incidents continue to occur</i> <i>in various parts of the world.</i>

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:29.080
<i>Shall l see a bit of the world?</i>

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:31.020
<i>Victor...</i>

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:34.690
Does this also have something to do with you two?

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:36.190
No...

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.630
Hmmm... ln that case, all right then.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:43.570
l'm surprised you're not pressing us for more information.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.660
We'd be happy to listen if you wanted to tell us.

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:49.670
But it doesn't seem as if we could really do anything about it,

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.510
even if we did know.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:55.110
Everyone is safe, and we're fine with that.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.320
You really have good friends.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.250
What are you talking about?

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.520
They're your friends now too, right?

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.690
Well, l'd be happy if that was so but,

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:11.890
l can't bear to involve them again, so l'm going to keep my distance a bit.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:16.630
Friends, to me, are comrades who'll fight alongside me.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.530
Right now, that's you and the Warrior Chief.

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:21.600
Have you heard from Bravo?

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.440
Nothing since we saw him.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:25.810
Does that make you worried?

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.910
About the black kakugane, you becoming like Victor...

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:31.140
Here,

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:38.760
You and Bravo are my comrades as well, so when the next mission comes,

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.350
l'd like it to be the three of us again.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.160
But for now, it's summer vacation.

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:47.720
So let's just take it easy until Bravo returns!

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:49.560
Yes, you're right.

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:00.340
lt's beautiful, isn't it?

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.410
lt's more deserted than l expected.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.380
lt's because l chose an unknown spot.

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:06.820
There's no place like the beach...

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:08.860
Your upper lip is stretching.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.950
You ain't seen nothin' yet.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.050
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.830
What is it? ls something wrong?

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:31.850
lt's not that; it's just that your belly button is showing.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:33.470
Don't point!

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:36.370
l had to go to a locaI store, and this was all they had!

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:38.580
Anyway, it's not like you've never seen it before!

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.280
You've seen it before?

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:41.910
Have l?

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.690
Don't stare!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.120
Sounds like innocent love!

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:47.860
Sounds like a middle school diary...

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:49.890
Hey, look over there!

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.830
lt's a surfer. A surfer!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.090
Hey, that's...

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.630
Captain Bravo!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.840
Yes, l AM!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.630
Hey, everyone.
How have you been?

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.510
How did you find us here?

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:06.850
What about your job?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.580
You know how to surf?

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.240
Will you tell us your real name already?!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:14.740
lt's all a secret. 'Cuz it's cooler that way.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:17.450
Sorry l wasn't able to join you on the way over.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:20.190
l've got a car, so leave the return trip to me.

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.420
All right!

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:23.930
We'll save half on train fare!

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:25.600
Welcome back, Bravo!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:28.200
Ahh... lt's good to be back.

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:32.240
Warrior Chief, Warrior Chief, what happened with that case...

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:36.270
Yes, yes, don't be in such a hurry.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:38.600
After all, we're here to enjoy the ocean.

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:40.770
At least, let me play while it's still light!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.150
Yahoo!

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:43.140
Unbelievable!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.100
You don't want to involve the others, do you?

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.970
Let's talk it over tonight...

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.290
Re-exterminate Kazuki Muto?!

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:20.860
That is the new mission ordered by the Alchemist Army.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:22.560
But l won't let them do that!

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.860
l won't allow anybody to do that!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.240
Next time, "New Strength."

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.470
I'll splatter your guts out!
